          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تسلیت گفتن (tasliyat goftan) — \"to offer condolences\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "همه همکاران به او تسلیت گفتند. Hame-ye hamkârân be u tasliyat goftand. All his colleagues offered him their condolences."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person takes be. Present stem gu-: tasliyat miguyam, in speech tasliyat migam \"my condolences\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tasliyat is usually traced to Arabic tasliya, \"consolation\"; EtymDB lists no entry. goftan \"to say\" is native Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
