              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وصیت (vasiyat) — \"a will, a last wish\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در وصیت خود خانه را به دخترش داد. Dar vasiyat-e khod khâne râ be dokhtarash dâd. In his will he left the house to his daughter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vasiyatnâme is a written will."
            }
          ]
        },
