              "text": "این فرش از مادربزرگم به ارث رسیده است. In farsh az mâdarbozorgam be ers reside ast. This carpet came down to me from my grandmother."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Written with ث. Be ers residan \"to be inherited\"."
